<title>FRANCE: RALLYING-DAKAR RALLY SECOND STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-DAKAR RALLY SECOND STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
